{"LID": 66, "STAGE": 3, "TITLE": "Participle Clauses", "TITLE_AR": "جمل المصدر (Participle Clauses)", "TIMER": 75, "XP": 50, "FULL_HTML": "\n<div class=\"lesson-content\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-family:'Segoe UI',Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.9;color:#1e293b\">\n\n<h1 style=\"color:#4f46e5;border-bottom:3px solid #4f46e5;padding-bottom:10px\">🎯 الدرس 21: جمل المصدر — Participle Clauses</h1>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eff6ff;border-right:5px solid #3b82f6;padding:16px 20px;border-radius:10px;margin:18px 0\">\n<h2 style=\"color:#1d4ed8;margin-bottom:8px\">📌 الهدف من الدرس</h2>\n<p>في نهاية هذا الدرس ستكون قادراً على:</p>\n<ul style=\"padding-right:20px\">\n<li>التمييز بين <b>Present Participle (V-ing)</b> و <b>Past Participle (V3)</b>.</li>\n<li>اختصار الجمل الطويلة إلى <b>جمل مصدر</b> أنيقة.</li>\n<li>استخدام <b>Perfect Participle</b> (Having + V3) للتسلسل الزمني.</li>\n<li>تجنّب خطأ <b>Dangling Modifier</b> (المصدر المعلّق) الشائع.</li>\n<li>رفع مستوى الكتابة الأكاديمية بصياغة احترافية.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#dc2626;margin-top:24px\">🔑 ما هو Participle Clause؟</h2>\n<div style=\"background:#fef3c7;border:2px solid #f59e0b;border-radius:12px;padding:16px;margin:14px 0\">\n<p style=\"font-size:17px;font-weight:600\">هو اختصار لجملة فرعية باستخدام <b>V-ing</b> أو <b>V3</b> بدلاً من فاعل + فعل كامل.</p>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:10px\">\n<tr style=\"background:#fde68a\"><th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\">الجملة الطويلة</th><th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\">الجملة المختصرة (Participle)</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\">Because I was tired, I went to bed early.</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\"><b>Being tired</b>, I went to bed early.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\">The man who is wearing glasses is my teacher.</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\">The man <b>wearing glasses</b> is my teacher.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\">The book which was written by Tolstoy is famous.</td><td style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #f59e0b\">The book <b>written by Tolstoy</b> is famous.</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>💡 الفائدة:</b> جمل أقصر، أكثر أناقة، ومستوى أكاديمي أعلى.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#059669;margin-top:24px\">📚 الأنواع الثلاثة للمصدر</h2>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#7c3aed\">1️⃣ Present Participle (V-ing) — للمعنى الفاعل (Active)</h3>\n<p>نستخدمه عندما يكون الفاعل <b>يفعل الشيء</b> (Active):</p>\n<ul style=\"padding-right:20px\">\n<li><b>Walking</b> down the street, I met an old friend. (وأنا أمشي = أنا الذي يمشي)</li>\n<li>The boy <b>running</b> in the park is my brother. (الولد الذي يجري = هو من يجري)</li>\n<li><b>Feeling</b> tired, she decided to rest. (شاعرة بالتعب = هي من تشعر)</li>\n</ul>\n<div style=\"background:#dbeafe;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;margin:10px 0\">\n<b>💡 يُستخدم لـ:</b> سبب (Being sick) / زمن (While walking) / صفة (a smiling face).\n</div>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#7c3aed\">2️⃣ Past Participle (V3) — للمعنى المفعول (Passive)</h3>\n<p>نستخدمه عندما يكون الفاعل <b>يقع عليه الفعل</b> (Passive):</p>\n<ul style=\"padding-right:20px\">\n<li><b>Built</b> in 1900, the house still stands. (التي بُنيت = حدث الفعل عليها)</li>\n<li>The letter <b>written</b> by my grandfather is precious. (التي كُتبت)</li>\n<li><b>Surprised</b> by the news, he couldn't speak. (مفاجَأ = الخبر فاجأه)</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 style=\"color:#7c3aed\">3️⃣ Perfect Participle (Having + V3) — لفعل سبق فعلاً آخر</h3>\n<p>نستخدمه عندما نريد التأكيد على أن فعلاً انتهى قبل فعل آخر:</p>\n<ul style=\"padding-right:20px\">\n<li><b>Having finished</b> her work, she went home. (بعد أن أنهت عملها، ذهبت)</li>\n<li><b>Having lived</b> in Paris for 10 years, he speaks French fluently. (بسبب عيشه السابق)</li>\n<li><b>Having been told</b> the truth, she felt relieved. (Perfect Passive)</li>\n</ul>\n<div style=\"background:#fee2e2;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;border-right:4px solid #dc2626;margin:10px 0\">\n<b>⚠️ مهم:</b> Having + V3 يعني الفعل <b>انتهى قبل</b> الفعل الرئيسي، وليس متزامناً معه.\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#dc2626;margin-top:24px\">🔧 خطوات اختصار الجملة</h2>\n<div style=\"background:#dcfce7;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border-right:4px solid #16a34a;margin:14px 0\">\n<p><b>1) احذف الفاعل المكرر</b> (إذا كان نفس الفاعل في الجملتين):</p>\n<p>📖 <s>Because she was hungry, she</s> ate quickly. → <b>Being hungry</b>, she ate quickly.</p>\n\n<p><b>2) احذف الضمير الموصول (who/which/that) + verb to be</b>:</p>\n<p>📖 The girl <s>who is</s> standing there → The girl <b>standing</b> there.</p>\n\n<p><b>3) إذا كانت الجملة فعّالة → V-ing | إذا كانت مبنية للمجهول → V3</b>:</p>\n<p>📖 The man <s>who broke</s> the window → The man <b>breaking</b> the window. (Active)</p>\n<p>📖 The window <s>that was broken</s> → The window <b>broken</b>. (Passive)</p>\n\n<p><b>4) لتسلسل الأحداث، استخدم Having + V3</b>:</p>\n<p>📖 <s>After she had finished</s>, she left. → <b>Having finished</b>, she left.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#dc2626;margin-top:24px\">⚠️ الخطأ الشائع: Dangling Modifier (المصدر المعلّق)</h2>\n<div style=\"background:#fee2e2;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border-right:5px solid #dc2626;margin:14px 0\">\n<p style=\"font-weight:600\">القاعدة الذهبية: <b>الفاعل الضمني في جملة المصدر يجب أن يكون نفس فاعل الجملة الرئيسية!</b></p>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:10px\">\n<tr style=\"background:#fecaca\"><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">❌ خطأ (Dangling)</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">✅ صحيح</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">Walking down the street, <b>a car</b> hit me.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">Walking down the street, <b>I</b> was hit by a car.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">Looking through the window, <b>the garden</b> looked beautiful.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">Looking through the window, <b>I</b> saw a beautiful garden.</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p style=\"margin-top:10px\">📖 في المثال الأول: السيارة لا تمشي! الفاعل الضمني لـ \"walking\" يجب أن يكون \"I\".</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#dc2626;margin-top:24px\">🎯 Mini-Drill — اختصر الجمل التالية</h2>\n<div style=\"background:#f3e8ff;padding:16px;border-radius:10px;margin:14px 0\">\n<ol style=\"padding-right:24px\">\n<li>Because he was very tired, he went to sleep early. → <span style=\"color:#16a34a\"><b>Being very tired, he went to sleep early.</b></span></li>\n<li>The students who are studying for the exam look stressed. → <span style=\"color:#16a34a\"><b>The students studying for the exam look stressed.</b></span></li>\n<li>The novel which was published in 2010 became a bestseller. → <span style=\"color:#16a34a\"><b>The novel published in 2010 became a bestseller.</b></span></li>\n<li>After she had finished her homework, she watched TV. → <span style=\"color:#16a34a\"><b>Having finished her homework, she watched TV.</b></span></li>\n<li>While I was walking in the park, I saw a rainbow. → <span style=\"color:#16a34a\"><b>Walking in the park, I saw a rainbow.</b></span></li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#dc2626;margin-top:24px\">⚠️ الأخطاء العشرة الشائعة</h2>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:14px 0;font-size:15px\">\n<tr style=\"background:#fecaca\"><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">❌ خطأ شائع</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">✅ الصواب</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">السبب</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">The book <s>writing</s> by Tolstoy.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">The book <b>written</b> by Tolstoy.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">passive → V3</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">The man <s>broken</s> the window ran away.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">The man <b>breaking</b> the window ran away.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">active → V-ing</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\"><s>Finishing</s> her work, she had felt happy.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\"><b>Having finished</b> her work, she felt happy.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">تسلسل → Having + V3</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">Walking on the road, <s>a dog</s> barked at me.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">Walking on the road, <b>I</b> heard a dog bark.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">Dangling modifier</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">The girl <s>who</s> standing there is my sister.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">The girl standing there is my sister.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">احذف who + is</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\"><s>To be</s> tired, he went to bed.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\"><b>Being</b> tired, he went to bed.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">للسبب نستخدم Being</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">The cake <s>baking</s> by my mother is delicious.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">The cake <b>baked</b> by my mother is delicious.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">passive → V3</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\"><s>Have</s> finished, she left.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\"><b>Having</b> finished, she left.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">دائماً Having (وليس Have)</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">Climbing the mountain, <s>the view</s> was beautiful.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">Climbing the mountain, <b>we</b> saw a beautiful view.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">المنظر لا يتسلّق!</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">She entered <s>smiled</s>.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">She entered <b>smiling</b>.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #dc2626\">للحال الفاعل → V-ing</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#dc2626;margin-top:24px\">🧠 حِيَل الذاكرة</h2>\n<div style=\"background:#dcfce7;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;border-right:4px solid #16a34a;margin:10px 0\">\n<p>🎯 <b>قاعدة \"ING للفاعل، ED للمفعول\":</b> Active → V-ing | Passive → V3.</p>\n<p>🎯 <b>قاعدة \"Having للسابق\":</b> Having + V3 = فعل انتهى قبل فعل آخر.</p>\n<p>🎯 <b>قاعدة \"نفس الفاعل\":</b> الفاعل في المصدر = الفاعل في الجملة الرئيسية (تجنّب Dangling).</p>\n<p>🎯 <b>قاعدة \"احذف who/which is\":</b> The man who is running = The man running.</p>\n<p>🎯 <b>قاعدة \"Being للسبب\":</b> Because + جملة → Being + adj.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 style=\"color:#dc2626;margin-top:24px\">📊 Quick Recap — الملخص النهائي</h2>\n<table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:14px 0;font-size:15px\">\n<tr style=\"background:#1e40af;color:#fff\"><th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #1e40af\">النوع</th><th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #1e40af\">الصيغة</th><th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #1e40af\">المعنى</th><th style=\"padding:10px;border:1px solid #1e40af\">مثال</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">Present Participle</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">V-ing</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">Active</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">The boy running away...</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">Past Participle</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">V3</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">Passive</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">The book written by him...</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">Perfect Participle</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">Having + V3</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">فعل سابق</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">Having finished, he left.</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">Perfect Passive</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">Having been + V3</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">passive سابق</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">Having been warned,...</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">Being + adj</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">Being + صفة</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">للسبب</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #94a3b8\">Being tired, I slept.</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"lesson-content\" dir=\"rtl\"><h2 style=\"color:#4f46e5;border-bottom:2px solid #4f46e5;padding-bottom:6px\">📖 أمثلة تطبيقية (15)</h2><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:10px 0;font-size:15px\"><tr style=\"background:#4f46e5;color:#fff\"><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #4f46e5\">#</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #4f46e5\">English</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #4f46e5\">العربية</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #4f46e5\">القاعدة</th></tr><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">1</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">Feeling exhausted after the long flight, the passengers went straight to the hotel.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">بشعورهم بالإرهاق بعد الرحلة الطويلة، توجّه الركاب مباشرة إلى الفندق.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Present Participle للسبب (Active)</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">2</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">The novel written by Naguib Mahfouz won the Nobel Prize.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">الرواية المكتوبة بواسطة نجيب محفوظ فازت بجائزة نوبل.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Past Participle (Passive)</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">3</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">Having completed the project, the team celebrated their success.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">بعد أن أكمل الفريق المشروع، احتفلوا بنجاحهم.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Perfect Participle (فعل سابق)</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">4</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">The students sitting in the front row are the most engaged.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">الطلاب الجالسون في الصف الأمامي هم الأكثر تفاعلاً.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">اختصار who/which is (Active)</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">5</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">Surprised by the announcement, the audience burst into applause.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">بمفاجأتهم من الإعلان، انفجر الجمهور في تصفيق.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Past Participle للحال (Passive)</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">6</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">Walking through the ancient ruins, we felt transported back in time.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">ونحن نمشي في الأطلال القديمة، شعرنا أنّنا عُدنا بالزمن.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Present Participle للزمن المتزامن</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">7</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">Having been warned about the dangers, the hikers turned back.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">بعد تحذيرهم من المخاطر، عاد المتنزّهون أدراجهم.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Perfect Passive (Having been + V3)</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">8</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">The bridge built in the 19th century is still in use today.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">الجسر الذي بُني في القرن التاسع عشر لا يزال مستخدماً حتى اليوم.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Past Participle لجملة وصفية</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">9</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">Being a doctor, she knew exactly what to do in the emergency.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">كونها طبيبة، عرفت تماماً ما تفعل في الحالة الطارئة.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Being + noun (للسبب)</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">10</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">Looking at the painting carefully, she noticed a hidden signature.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">بنظرتها الدقيقة إلى اللوحة، لاحظت توقيعاً مخفياً.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Present Participle بداية الجملة</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">11</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">Damaged by the storm, the old tree had to be cut down.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">تضرّر بسبب العاصفة، اضطُرّوا لقطع الشجرة العتيقة.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Past Participle للسبب</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">12</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">Having traveled to over 30 countries, she has many fascinating stories.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">بعد سفرها إلى أكثر من 30 دولة، لديها كثير من القصص المشوّقة.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Perfect Participle لخبرة سابقة</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">13</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">The man wearing the red jacket is the new manager.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">الرجل الذي يرتدي الجاكيت الأحمر هو المدير الجديد.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">V-ing للوصف (Active)</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">14</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">Rejected by several publishers, the author finally self-published her book.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">بعد رفضها من عدة ناشرين، نشرت الكاتبة كتابها بنفسها أخيراً.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Past Participle للسبب (Passive)</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f8fafc\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;text-align:center\">15</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;direction:ltr;text-align:left\">Living in a foreign country, you learn to appreciate your own culture.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1\">عند العيش في بلد أجنبي، تتعلّم تقدير ثقافتك.</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Present Participle للحالة العامة</td></tr></table></div>\n<div class=\"lesson-content\" dir=\"rtl\"><h2 style=\"color:#059669;border-bottom:2px solid #059669;padding-bottom:6px\">📚 المفردات الأساسية (18)</h2><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:10px 0;font-size:15px\"><tr style=\"background:#059669;color:#fff\"><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #059669\">الكلمة</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #059669\">النطق IPA</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #059669\">الترجمة</th><th style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #059669\">مثال</th></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">participle</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ˈpɑːrtɪsɪpl/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">اسم الفاعل/المفعول</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">V-ing is a present participle.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">clause</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/klɔːz/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">جملة فرعية</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">A participle clause is concise.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">concise</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/kənˈsaɪs/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">موجز / مختصر</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Good writing is concise.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">exhausted</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ɪɡˈzɔːstɪd/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">منهك</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Feeling exhausted, she rested.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">announcement</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/əˈnaʊnsmənt/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">إعلان</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">The announcement surprised everyone.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">hidden</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ˈhɪdn/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">مخفيّ</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">She found a hidden message.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">signature</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ˈsɪɡnətʃər/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">توقيع</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">The signature was barely visible.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">damaged</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ˈdæmɪdʒd/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">متضرّر / تالف</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">The damaged car was towed away.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">fascinating</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ˈfæsɪneɪtɪŋ/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">مشوّق / آسر</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Her stories are fascinating.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">engaged</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ɪnˈɡeɪdʒd/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">منهمك / مهتمّ</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Engaged students learn faster.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">applause</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/əˈplɔːz/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">تصفيق</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">The speech got loud applause.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">ruins</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ˈruːɪnz/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">أطلال</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">They visited Roman ruins.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">transported</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/trænsˈpɔːrtɪd/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">منقول / محمول</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">I felt transported in time.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">reject</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/rɪˈdʒekt/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">يرفض</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Don't be afraid to reject bad offers.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">publish</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ˈpʌblɪʃ/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">ينشر</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">She publishes a book every year.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">appreciate</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/əˈpriːʃieɪt/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">يقدّر</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">I appreciate your help.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#fff\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">dangling</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ˈdæŋɡlɪŋ/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">متدلّ / معلّق</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Avoid dangling modifiers.</td></tr><tr style=\"background:#f0fdf4\"><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;font-weight:700;text-align:left\">emergency</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;color:#7c3aed;text-align:left\">/ɪˈmɜːrdʒənsi/</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac\">طارئ / حالة طوارئ</td><td style=\"padding:8px;border:1px solid #86efac;direction:ltr;text-align:left;font-size:13px;color:#475569\">Call 911 in an emergency.</td></tr></table></div>"}